{"id":"mar","lemma":"mar","pos":"noun","rank":706,"glosses":["sea","seaside","lunar mare"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɾ/","gender":"mf","forms":{"masculine":"mar","plural":"mares"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-mar.wav","formAudio":{"mares":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-mares.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Me gustaría ir al mar contigo.","en":"I'd like to go to the seaside with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568430","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"with you"}]},{"text":"El mar es azul.","en":"The sea is blue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221603","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"blue"}]},{"text":"Nunca he visto el mar.","en":"I've never seen the sea.","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Me entiendes la mar de bien.","en":"You understand me very well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611832","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"A su derecha pueden ver el mar.","en":"If you look to your right, you'll see the sea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155069","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"right"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}